  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stellaris-stellarview-compatibility-resourcepack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1482062?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=626e7b&amp;label=Resourcepack version\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstellaris-stellarview-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/stellaris-stellarview-compatibility?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=626e7b&amp;label=Modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lukaskabc/Stellaris-StellarView-Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p><p>Отключает пользовательское небо в Stellaris и настраивает небо StellarView для каждой планеты.</p><h2>Зависимости</h2><table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>StellarView Mixin Renderer</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/lukaskabc/StellarViewMixinRenderer/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstellar-view-mixin-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellar-view-mixin-renderer\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Stellaris</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/st0x0ef/stellaris/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstellaris\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellaris\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>StellarView</td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/Povstalec/stellarview/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=GitHub\" alt=\"GitHub\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstellarview\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n      <td>\n        <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellarview\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n          <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-grey?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\">\n        </a>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table><h2>Реализованные планеты/измерения</h2><ul>\n<li>Земля (верхний мир)</li>\n<li>Орбита Земли</li>\n<li>Юпитер</li>\n<li>Марс</li>\n<li>Орбита Марса</li>\n<li>Меркурий</li>\n<li>Орбита Меркурия</li>\n<li>Луна</li>\n<li>Венера</li>\n<li>Орбита Венеры</li>\n</ul>",
